fix               2 water nvt temp 300.0 300.0 100.0
fix               7 2ClBen nvt temp 300.0 300.0 100.0
fix               8 PSS rigid/nvt molecule temp 300.0 300.0 100
  1 rigid bodies with 388 atoms
fix               9 na nvt temp 300.0 300.0 100.0
fix               10 HBAB nvt temp 300.0 300.0 100.0
fix               11 br nvt temp 300.0 300.0 100.0

fix               12 all colvars mix.colvars
